---
// A bulleted recap dropped at the end of a lesson's MDX body, as the
// article's closing element — the scannable version of what the lesson
// just covered. Content is written as a plain markdown list in the
// default slot (same pattern MathBox already uses for its prose), so it
// flows through the normal remark pipeline rather than needing raw HTML.
---
<div class="key-takeaways">
  <div class="key-takeaways-label">Key takeaways</div>
  <div class="key-takeaways-body"><slot /></div>
</div>
